    "wreck": {"turret_yaw_deg": 15, "tilt_deg": [3, 0, -6]},
    "doc": "Amphibious carrier (veh_scout + amphibious). float skirt|pontoon|hover, roof rws|radar|mast|crown|sensors, deck (style kit), skirt (style kit). Waterjets / fans spin (ROTOR). Sockets muzzle0_0, muzzle1_0, exhaust0, door_exit, top."
